BT 1 0 0 1 0 42.7 Tm /F1 9.3 Tf 13 TL (This project presents the design of a simple automatic night lamp controller. An LDR senses the surrounding light) Tj T* (level and a BC547B NPN transistor acts as an electronic switch. The circuit turns the LED on when the surroundings) Tj T* (become dark and switches it off when daylight is present. KiCad is used to document the schematic, assign) Tj T* (component footprints and design the PCB layout.) Tj T* ET
